<BaseLayout
  title="Why This Library Takes No Side · America's School Trust Library"
  description="A second note from the founder of America's School Trust Library: why a fact-keeping institution must stay separate from the advocacy beside it, and how that wall is built to be checked rather than trusted on faith."
